OL,3,GNEWSAGlass deposit operator confirmed
OL,4,Aafter months of wrangling
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn organisation to manage Wales'
OL,7,Fdeposit return scheme (DRS) has been
OL,8,Fappointed by the Welsh government
OL,9,Ffollowing months of discussions over
OL,10,Fthe inclusion of glass.
OL,12,FExchange for Change, which had already
OL,13,Fbeen chosen to run the new recycling
OL,14,Fprogrammes in the rest of the UK, will
OL,15,Frun Wales' DRS from its launch in
OL,16,FOctober 2027.
OL,18,FDrinks industry lobbyists had
OL,19,Fpreviously warned that the time taken
OL,20,Fto appoint Wales' operator had risked
OL,21,Fdelaying the launch of the scheme.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
