OL,3,GNEWSAGlass deposit operator confirmed
OL,4,Aafter months of wrangling
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a written statement LlE7r Gruffydd,
OL,7,Fthe sustainability minister, said the
OL,8,Fappointment marked the "next step"
OL,9,Ftowards improved recycling and reuse.
